[heading]Version 0.6.11[/heading]

[list]
[*]Reduced NPC companions being duplicated when you travel with the SCore / XNPCCore companion system used by overhauls like The Wasteland, by changing how the teleport moves the player. In testing companions no longer multiplied each trip; the companion behavior itself is the framework's, not this mod's.
[*]Following NPC companions are now gathered neatly around you on solid ground when you arrive, instead of being left buried in the floor or stuck in walls. Only your own companions that came along are moved, and nothing changes on setups without companions.
[*]No save reset required.
[/list]
